  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Raheman Babu Muchale vs The State Of Maharashtra on 11 August, 2023 Author: Anuja Prabhudessai Bench: Anuja Prabhudessai Megha 15_aba_2234_2023.doc In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.2234 Of 2023 Rahiman Babu Muchale ...Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra ...Respondent ... Mr. Jaydeep Mane for the Applicant. Mr. S.V. Gavand, App for Respondent -State. Coram : Smt. Anuja Prabhudessai, J. Dated : 11th August, 2023. P.C.:- 1. The Applicant apprehends his arrest in Crime No.579 of 2021 registered with Jodbhavipe Police Station, District-Solapur, for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273 and 328 of the Ipc and Section 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "It is alleged that on 26/11/2021 the co-accused was found in possession of banned Gutkha. The Gutkha found in possession of the co- accused has been seized and the co-accused have been taken into custody. It is stated that in the course of the interrogation, co-accused have made a statement that they had received Gutkha from Raheman Babu Muchale vs The State Of Maharashtra on 11 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/176575508/ 1 the Applicant herein. 4. At this stage, apart from the statement of the co-accused, there is no other material on record to indicate that the Applicant was the supplier. Hence, this is a fit case for granting interim bail.",
    "arguments": "",
